    "cards": [
      {
        "title": "Mutual Fund Enquiry",
        "meta": [],
        "links": [],
        "template": "**\ud83d\udccb Open a Mutual Fund Account \u2013 Required Documents**\n\nTo open your Mutual Fund account, please share the following:\n\n1. \ud83d\udcc4 PAN Card & Aadhaar Card copies\n2. \ud83d\udce7 Email ID & \ud83d\udcf1 Mobile Number\n3. \ud83c\udfe6 Any one of the following:\n   * Cancelled Cheque, or\n   * Last 3 months' Bank Statement (showing Account Number), or\n   * Bank Passbook (First Page + Last 3 months' entries)\n4. \ud83c\udf0d Place of Birth (City, State & Country)\n5. \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67 Nominee Details:\n   * PAN Card or Aadhaar Card\n   * Email ID\n   * Mobile Number\n\nOnce I receive the above, I'll complete your account opening process.\n\n**Vemuri Financial Services**\n*Simple. Smart. Secure Finance.*\n\n\ud83d\udcde 9886291668\n\ud83d\udce7 [vemurifin@gmail.com](mailto:vemurifin@gmail.com)\n\ud83c\udf10 https://fin.vemurigroup.in"
      },
      {
        "title": "Term Insurance Enquiry",
        "meta": [],
        "links": [],
        "template": "**\ud83d\udccb Term Insurance Quote \u2013 Required Details**\nTo provide you with the most suitable **Term Insurance** quote, please share the following details:\n\n* \ud83d\udc64 Full Name:\n* \ud83d\udebb Gender:\n* \ud83c\udf82 Date of Birth:\n* \ud83d\udcbc Occupation:\n* \ud83d\udcb0 Gross Annual Income:\n* \ud83d\udccd PIN Code:\n* \ud83c\udf93 Highest Qualification:\n* \ud83d\udcc5 Policy Term:\n* \ud83d\udcb3 Premium Payment Term:\n* \ud83d\udead Smoker (Yes/No):\n* \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Required Sum Assured:\n* \ud83d\udcc4 Existing Life Insurance Details (if any):\n\nOnce I receive the above information, I'll compare plans and recommend the best option based on your needs.\n**Vemuri Financial Services**\n*Simple. Smart. Secure Finance.*\n\n\ud83d\udcde 9886291668\n\ud83d\udce7 [vemurifin@gmail.com](mailto:vemurifin@gmail.com)\n\ud83c\udf10 https://fin.vemurigroup.in"
      },
      {
        "title": "Health Insurance Enquiry",
        "meta": [],
        "links": [],
        "template": "**\ud83d\udccb Health Insurance Quote \u2013 Required Details**\nPlease share the following details:\n* \ud83d\udc64 Name\n* \ud83c\udf82 Date of Birth\n* \ud83d\udccf Height & Weight\n* \ud83d\udce7 Email ID\n* \ud83d\udcf1 Mobile Number\n* \ud83c\udd94 PAN Number\n* \ud83c\udfe0 Address & PIN Code\n* \ud83d\udcbc Occupation & Annual Income\n* \ud83d\udc8d Marital Status\n* \ud83c\udfe5 Existing Illnesses / Medications / Surgeries (if any)\n* \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Required Sum Assured & Policy Term\n* \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67 Nominee Name, DOB & Relationship\nThank you! Once I receive the details, I'll recommend the best health insurance plan for you.\n\n**Vemuri Financial Services**\n\ud83d\udcde 9886291668 | \ud83c\udf10 https://fin.vemurigroup.in"
      },
      {
        "title": "Mutual Fund Success",
        "meta": [],
        "links": [],
        "template": "\ud83c\udf1f **Welcome to Your Financial Planning Journey!**\nYour investment account has been created successfully.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **App:** https://tinyurl.com/vemuriapp\n\ud83c\udf10 **Portal:** https://tinyurl.com/vemurimf\n\n\ud83d\udd10 **Login Credentials**\n\ud83d\udc64 Username: **PAN Number**\n\ud83d\udd11 Password: **Welcome@123**\n\nI'm here to help you with:\n\u2705 Mutual Funds & SIPs\n\u2705 Portfolio Review\n\u2705 Financial Planning\n\n**Insurance | Mutual Funds | NPS | Tax Saving | Retirement | Loans**\nThank you for choosing **Vemuri Financial Services**.\n\n\ud83d\udcde 9886291668\n\ud83d\udce7 [vemurifin@gmail.com](mailto:vemurifin@gmail.com)\n\ud83c\udf10 https://fin.vemurigroup.in"
      },
      {
        "title": "Term Insurance Success",
