        "template": "\u2705 Your **Axis Max Life Term Insurance** application has been successfully submitted.\n\nPlease log in to review your policy and update your personal & nominee details.\n\n\ud83c\udf10 **Web:** https://www.axismaxlife.com/cs/login\n\ud83d\udcf1 **App:** https://tinyurl.com/axismaxapp\n\nThank you for choosing **Vemuri Financial Services**. If you're happy with my service, kindly refer your friends and family.\n\n**Vemuri Financial Services**\n*Simple. Smart. Secure Finance.*\nInsurance | Mutual Funds | NPS | Tax Saving | Retirement | Home & Personal Loans\n\n\ud83d\udcde 9886291668\n\ud83d\udce7 [vemurifin@gmail.com](mailto:vemurifin@gmail.com)\n\ud83c\udf10 https://fin.vemurigroup.in"
